12
01:03:09,473 --> 01:03:15,473
Red Riding Hood is a 2011 American romantic fantasy horror film directed by Catherine Hardwicke,
and produced by Leonardo DiCaprio, from a screenplay by David Leslie Johnson.

13
01:08:25,263 --> 01:08:31,263
The film is very loosely based on the folk tale "Little Red Riding Hood" collected by both Charles Perrault under the name Le Petit
Chaperon Rouge (Little Red Riding Hood) and several decades later by the Brothers Grimm as Rotkäppchen (Little Red Cap).

14
01:13:41,052 --> 01:13:47,052
It stars Amanda Seyfried as the title role, with Gary Oldman, Billy Burke, Shiloh Fernandez,
Max Irons, Virginia Madsen, Lukas Haas and Julie Christie in supporting roles.

15
01:18:56,842 --> 01:19:02,842
Red Riding Hood had its world premiere at Hollywood on March 7, 2011, and
was theatrically released on March 11, 2011, by Warner Bros.

16
01:24:12,631 --> 01:24:18,631
The film received negative reviews, and was a box-office success,
grossing $98 million worldwide against its $42 million budget.

17
01:29:28,421 --> 01:29:34,421
The film explores themes of winter, fairy tale,
little red riding hood, hood, werewolf.

18
01:34:44,210 --> 01:34:50,210
The tone is mind_bending and dark and emotional.
